  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say \"a total of 50 new workers must be trained by the end of the 8th week,\" do you mean that 50 trainees must have COMPLETED their 2-week training (i.e., become productive workers) by the end of week 8, or that 50 trainees must have STARTED training by the end of week 8 (some of whom would still be in training at week 8's end)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy clarification regarding the definition of 'trained' (completed vs. started) by the deadline. Although it presents two options, it requires one specific choice to resolve the ambiguity."
}

